1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,648
For three years, Ethan Drake had carried the heaviest burdens

2
00:00:02,648 --> 00:00:05,296
of the Vanguard Guild.

3
00:00:05,296 --> 00:00:09,016
While the elite strike teams claimed the glory, the press

4
00:00:09,016 --> 00:00:12,736
conferences, and the multi-million credit bounties, Ethan walked three paces

5
00:00:12,736 --> 00:00:16,456
behind—an unranked core porter whose mana channels had been deemed

6
00:00:16,456 --> 00:00:20,176
permanently fractured since birth.

7
00:00:20,176 --> 00:00:22,887
He was the invisible mule of Sector Nine...

8
00:00:22,887 --> 00:00:24,087
until tonight.

9
00:00:24,087 --> 00:00:27,681
Across the grand banquet hall of House Vance, beneath crystal

10
00:00:27,681 --> 00:00:31,275
chandeliers that mirrored the cold rain beating against the high

11
00:00:31,275 --> 00:00:34,869
windows, his loyalty was publicly auctioned.

12
00:00:34,869 --> 00:00:37,517
Lady Evelyn Cross did not lower her voice.

13
00:00:39,408 --> 00:00:42,571
In a forgotten service corridor beneath the monorail tracks, Ethan’s

14
00:00:42,571 --> 00:00:45,734
knees finally buckled.

15
00:00:45,734 --> 00:00:47,472
His vital signs cratered.

16
00:00:47,472 --> 00:00:50,670
His vision tunnelled into pitch darkness as his heart rhythm

17
00:00:50,670 --> 00:00:53,868
stuttered to a near standstill.

18
00:00:53,868 --> 00:00:55,328
Two percent vitality.

19
00:00:55,328 --> 00:00:58,248
The threshold where mortal biology ceases.

20
00:00:58,248 --> 00:01:00,924
Yet, at the absolute edge of clinical death, the ambient

21
00:01:00,924 --> 00:01:03,600
air grew motionless.

22
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:06,659
The sound of pouring rain halted in mid-air.

23
00:01:06,659 --> 00:01:09,961
A crimson interface, forged from dark obsidian glass, crystallised directly

24
00:01:09,961 --> 00:01:13,263
before his retinas.

25
00:01:13,263 --> 00:01:17,781
Emergency Protocol Initialised: Host Biological Failure Imminent.

26
00:01:17,781 --> 00:01:20,283
Celestial Core Diagnostics Complete.

27
00:01:20,283 --> 00:01:23,133
Dormant Sovereign Protocol: Synchronised.

28
00:01:23,133 --> 00:01:27,026
Unlike the fragile blue interfaces issued by the International Hunter

29
00:01:27,026 --> 00:01:30,919
Ministry, this system bore no rank limits.

30
00:01:30,919 --> 00:01:32,240
No guild oversight.

31
00:01:32,240 --> 00:01:35,206
A cascade of warm, liquid fire surged outward from his

32
00:01:35,206 --> 00:01:38,172
fractured spine, burning away the necrotic tissue of his ruined

33
00:01:38,172 --> 00:01:41,138
channels.

34
00:01:41,138 --> 00:01:46,317
His notification log flashed a single baseline calibration: Host Physical

35
00:01:46,317 --> 00:01:51,496
Attributes Re-Indexed: Base Constitution Allocated: Two Hundred Points.

36
00:01:53,856 --> 00:01:55,349
Ethan rose to his feet.

37
00:01:55,349 --> 00:01:57,816
The persistent ache that had plagued his chest for seven

38
00:01:57,816 --> 00:02:00,283
years had vanished.

39
00:02:00,283 --> 00:02:03,551
In its place was a dense, heavy stillness—a weight distribution

40
00:02:03,551 --> 00:02:06,819
within his muscles that felt less like biological tissue and

41
00:02:06,819 --> 00:02:10,087
more like forged tungsten.

42
00:02:10,087 --> 00:02:14,307
The system displayed a strict requirement: [Current Level: 1.

43
00:02:15,864 --> 00:02:18,556
A Level Two Shadowfang Hound—a beast engineered for ambushing civilian

44
00:02:18,556 --> 00:02:21,248
scavengers.

45
00:02:21,248 --> 00:02:25,023
With a guttural snarl, the alpha lunged across twenty paces,

46
00:02:25,023 --> 00:02:28,798
its serrated fangs aimed directly for Ethan’s jugular.

47
00:02:28,798 --> 00:02:31,949
Ordinary instincts would have screamed to dodge.

48
00:02:31,949 --> 00:02:34,510
But Ethan stood completely still, his eyes tracking the creature's

49
00:02:34,510 --> 00:02:37,071
trajectory.

50
00:02:37,071 --> 00:02:40,748
He raised his bare left forearm to intercept the strike.

51
00:02:40,748 --> 00:02:41,948
CRACK.

52
00:02:41,948 --> 00:02:44,509
The sound that echoed through the stone corridor was not

53
00:02:44,509 --> 00:02:47,070
the tearing of flesh.

54
00:02:47,070 --> 00:02:49,302
It was the sharp, violent snap of bone breaking against

55
00:02:49,302 --> 00:02:51,534
solid steel.

56
00:02:51,534 --> 00:02:54,357
The beast’s upper jaw shattered on contact.

57
00:02:54,357 --> 00:02:57,377
Its fangs splintered into fragments, scattering across the wet flags

58
00:02:57,377 --> 00:03:00,397
like cracked porcelain.

59
00:03:00,397 --> 00:03:04,227
To a creature possessing a combined physical strength of barely

60
00:03:04,227 --> 00:03:08,057
fifteen points, clamping down on Ethan’s two-hundred Constitution was equivalent

61
00:03:08,057 --> 00:03:11,887
to biting an industrial anvil.

62
00:03:11,887 --> 00:03:14,218
Ethan felt nothing more than a dull kinetic vibration against

63
00:03:14,218 --> 00:03:16,549
his skin.

64
00:03:17,184 --> 00:03:20,204
Within the remains of the alpha hound lay an unformed

65
00:03:20,204 --> 00:03:23,224
skill orb—a rarity in low-tier sub-gates.

66
00:03:23,224 --> 00:03:26,911
Skill Manual Detected: Kinetic Resonance (Passive Tier 1).

67
00:03:26,911 --> 00:03:28,119
Absorb Neural Data?

68
00:03:28,119 --> 00:03:30,852
Ethan pressed his palm against the crystal.

69
00:03:30,852 --> 00:03:33,670
The orb dissolved into a sudden cascade of electrical telemetry,

70
00:03:33,670 --> 00:03:36,488
surging through his optic nerves and slamming into his motor

71
00:03:36,488 --> 00:03:39,306
cortex.

72
00:03:39,306 --> 00:03:41,913
This was not the painless, cartoonish mastery promised in low-grade

73
00:03:41,913 --> 00:03:44,520
guild manuals.

74
00:03:44,520 --> 00:03:49,256
Ethan gritted his teeth as his brain violently integrated ten

75
00:03:49,256 --> 00:03:53,992
thousand repetitions of rotational footwork, impact mitigation, and kinetic dispersion.

76
00:03:53,992 --> 00:03:56,535
A thin bead of sweat traced his jawline.

77
00:03:56,535 --> 00:04:00,159
His muscular fibres twitched in involuntary spasms as his nervous

78
00:04:00,159 --> 00:04:03,783
system recalibrated to the foreign motor memory.

79
00:04:03,783 --> 00:04:05,436
Thirty seconds of agony...

80
00:04:05,436 --> 00:04:07,279
followed by absolute clarity.

81
00:04:07,279 --> 00:04:10,394
Every punch he threw was no longer just raw mass.

82
00:04:10,394 --> 00:04:14,208
Kinetic Resonance transformed his natural bodily durability into an offensive

83
00:04:14,208 --> 00:04:18,022
weapon: whenever an opponent struck his flesh, the dissipated kinetic

84
00:04:18,022 --> 00:04:21,836
energy would be stored and discharged through his next counter-strike

85
00:04:21,836 --> 00:04:25,650
with double the force.

86
00:04:27,744 --> 00:04:29,764
They did not attack one by one.

87
00:04:29,764 --> 00:04:34,086
The Iron Jackals were ruthless professionals: on Grigor’s hand signal,

88
00:04:34,086 --> 00:04:38,408
the four riflemen on the catwalk opened fire simultaneously, while

89
00:04:38,408 --> 00:04:42,730
the melee squad advanced in a disciplined interlocking wedge.

90
00:04:42,730 --> 00:04:46,053
Ethan did not attempt a reckless open-field charge.

91
00:04:46,053 --> 00:04:49,670
Instead, he snapped backward on his heels, retreating six metres

92
00:04:49,670 --> 00:04:53,287
into the narrow mouth of the drainage conduit.

93
00:04:53,287 --> 00:04:57,066
In a three-metre wide corridor, fifteen men meant nothing.

94
00:04:57,066 --> 00:05:00,411
Their numerical advantage collapsed into a bottleneck where only two

95
00:05:00,411 --> 00:05:03,756
men could engage at a time, completely obstructing the riflemen's

96
00:05:03,756 --> 00:05:07,101
line of fire above.

97
00:05:07,101 --> 00:05:09,545
The first two syndicate enforcers lunged forward with electric stun

98
00:05:09,545 --> 00:05:11,989
batons.

99
00:05:11,989 --> 00:05:14,009
Ethan stepped into their guard.

100
00:05:20,328 --> 00:05:23,012
Grigor’s eyes bulged with primal terror.

101
00:05:23,012 --> 00:05:26,345
The pneumatic gauge on his hammer hissed violently, but the

102
00:05:26,345 --> 00:05:29,678
metal face had begun to cave inward under the sheer

103
00:05:29,678 --> 00:05:33,011
compressive pressure of Ethan’s grip.

104
00:05:33,011 --> 00:05:34,211
"Who...

105
00:05:34,211 --> 00:05:38,371
" Grigor stammered, frantically trying to dislodge the weapon.

106
00:05:38,371 --> 00:05:40,049
"We work for House Vance!

107
00:05:40,049 --> 00:05:43,270
" Ethan’s expression remained carved from ice.

108
00:05:43,270 --> 00:05:45,720
Arrogance backed by a noble family’s name was currency in

109
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:48,170
the upper city.

110
00:05:56,832 --> 00:05:59,088
The violence in the conduit had awakened the true master

111
00:05:59,088 --> 00:06:01,344
of the sub-gate.

112
00:06:09,504 --> 00:06:12,610
Within the dust of the fallen behemoth lay its pristine

113
00:06:12,610 --> 00:06:15,716
sovereign core—a pure violet anomaly worth at least fifty thousand

114
00:06:15,716 --> 00:06:18,822
guild credits on the open market.

115
00:06:18,822 --> 00:06:20,972
Enough capital to fund a solitary hunter’s equipment for an

116
00:06:20,972 --> 00:06:23,122
entire year.